いです。\n\n最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！\nたくさん要望をしてしまい申し訳ありません。\n是非ご検討よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/18ufwTteGbQtqWBd3-d95vTv4o14XWm12/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aru_03110602/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/afc6473b/uploads/origins/595c5151-55fc-4971-9a8b-874fca0ba1d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1e9265fc69705f8f456137d6679a1dd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afc6473b/uploads/origins/595c5151-55fc-4971-9a8b-874fca0ba1d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1e9265fc69705f8f456137d6679a1dd, https://si.imgix.net/afc6473b/uploads/origins/595c5151-55fc-4971-9a8b-874fca0ba1d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5810073c19fb4af6ca0b7a87176edba2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afc6473b/uploads/origins/595c5151-55fc-4971-9a8b-874fca0ba1d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=554e5ef16cff25d68cd90470926ac9b4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Sensei ~ I love your art and I want to have a cool illustration which I am wearing glasses.\nIf it is PSD file withseperate layers it is good for me. \nYou can design a pose for me and I have sent you a glasses reference in the google drive link.\nThank you.\n\n【使用用途】\n・収益化済み配信での使用 SNS活動での使用\n・配信活動用\n・グッズに使用する可能性がございます\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jhTiG61XsUxGlDlOZnPl8YkFQ4ODlnYS?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aru_03110602/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e40c9c7/uploads/origins/ae190129-6fd2-4820-bb1e-6ad7d7442f30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4762add25b71fee98bfddaa765924f96", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6e40c9c7/uploads/origins/ae190129-6fd2-4820-bb1e-6ad7d7442f30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4762add25b71fee98bfddaa7659